/T (However, platform leaders are cautioning that this convenience has limits. As generative components move from prototypes into mission-critical systems, teams are beginning to encounter the classic problems of large language models, namely hallucinated logic and non-deterministic behavior, in contexts where predictability is essential. This has sparked renewed investment in hybrid architectures that combine deterministic, rules-based logic with AI-generated components only where appropriate. 3.3 The Citizen Developer Movement Matures)
