/T (3.4 Governance, Security, and Compliance Move to the Center As low-code applications proliferate outside traditional IT oversight, governance has shifted from an afterthought to a first-order design requirement. Enterprises are prioritizing platforms with built-in role- based access controls, automated compliance checks, encryption at rest and in transit, and detailed audit trails. This is especially pronounced in regulated industries such as healthcare and financial services, where platforms must demonstrably support standards including GDPR, HIPAA, and PCI-DSS.)
/E (3.4 Governance, Security, and Compliance Move to the Center As low-code applications proliferate outside traditional IT oversight, governance has shifted from an afterthought to a first-order design requirement. Enterprises are prioritizing platforms with built-in role- based access controls, automated compliance checks, encryption at rest and in transit, and detailed audit trails. This is especially pronounced in regulated industries such as healthcare and financial services, where platforms must demonstrably support standards including GDPR, HIPAA, and PCI-DSS.)
