<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 71 0 R
/T (Low-code and no-code development has entered a new phase, one defined less by whether organizations will adopt these platforms and more by how quickly, how broadly, and under what governance model they will do so. The fusion of visual development with generative and agentic AI is compressing the time between idea and working software to an unprecedented degree, while simultaneously raising the stakes for security, compliance, and architectural discipline. Organizations that pair this speed with deliberate governance, clear ownership, and thoughtful platform strategy will be best positioned to turn low-code from a tactical convenience into a durable competitive advantage.)
/E (Low-code and no-code development has entered a new phase, one defined less by whether organizations will adopt these platforms and more by how quickly, how broadly, and under what governance model they will do so. The fusion of visual development with generative and agentic AI is compressing the time between idea and working software to an unprecedented degree, while simultaneously raising the stakes for security, compliance, and architectural discipline. Organizations that pair this speed with deliberate governance, clear ownership, and thoughtful platform strategy will be best positioned to turn low-code from a tactical convenience into a durable competitive advantage.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [13]
>>
