/Title (simultaneously, reflecting the reality that different platforms carry different strengths, whether in workflow automation, AI-agent orchestration, database application building, or front-end design. This is fueling a secondary trend: enterprise architecture and platform engineering teams are being tasked specifically with rationalizing and governing this expanding toolchain rather than trying to eliminate it.)
