523 0 obj
<<
/Title (Three forces are converging to accelerate this transformation. First, a persistent shortage of professional developers has pushed organizations to empower citizen developers, business analysts, and operations staff to build their own tools. Second, generative AI has fused with visual development environments, allowing applications and even autonomous agents to be described in plain language and generated automatically. Third, enterprises are formalizing governance frameworks, security controls, and platform consolidation strategies to manage the risk that comes with democratized development at scale.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 449 0 R
/Prev 501 0 R
/Next 502 0 R
>>
endobj
