525 0 obj
<<
/Title (Analysts expect AI copilots to be embedded in the large majority of enterprise workplace applications within the next year, and low-code specifically is emerging as the fastest on-ramp for organizations experimenting with agentic automation, because it lets teams prototype and test agent behavior visually before committing engineering resources to a fully custom build. 3.2 Conversational, Design-to-Code Development Platforms are increasingly merging conversational AI with design-to-code workflows, creating what several vendors describe as a new generation of co-pilot development environments. A user can sketch an interface, describe the desired behavior conversationally, and the platform generates both the visual layout and the underlying logic simultaneously. This blurs the historic line between prototyping tools and production-grade development platforms, compressing timelines that once spanned months into a matter of weeks.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 450 0 R
/Prev 538 0 R
/Next 504 0 R
>>
endobj
526 0 obj
