/Title (using pre-built components and configuration rather than writing extensive hand-coded logic. No-code platforms take this further, removing the need for any coding at all. Together, these approaches have matured from niche departmental tools into strategic infrastructure used by IT departments, business units, and independent software vendors alike.)
