547 0 obj
<<
/Title (The catalyst for this growth is straightforward: demand for digital applications has outpaced the supply of professional software engineers for more than a decade, and that gap continues to widen. Gartner and Forrester research consistently shows that citizen developers, employees who build applications without formal engineering training, are growing in number far faster than professional developers, and many large enterprises already report far more citizen builders than certified engineers on staff. At the same time, cloud infrastructure, API ecosystems, and now generative AI have made it dramatically easier to compose working software from existing parts rather than build everything from scratch.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 524 0 R
/Prev 546 0 R
/Next 536 0 R
>>
endobj
